   ],
   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "Medium = Baumann marine basal medium (8-component defined mineral base) with the paper's modifications: nitrogen supplied as 3 mM ammonium (not the 124 mM NH4Cl of the original Baumann recipe) and carbon supplied as one phytoplankton metabolite at 12 mM C. FeSO4 is the ONLY micronutrient in the cited Baumann BM; there is no separate trace-metal solution and no vitamins. The prior record's Co2+, Cu2+, Mn2+, Zn2+ exchanges and the generic 'Trace metal solution' are NOT supported by the cited Baumann medium and were dropped as unfounded (the 'Fe3+' and 'Fe2+ mitochondria' generic exchanges likewi"
  },
